  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion, garlic, and red bell pepper, cook until the vegetables are softened.",
    "Add the cumin, coriander, paprika, salt, and pepper, cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the crushed tomatoes, chickpeas, quinoa, and vegetable broth, bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover, and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Stir in the vegan white wine vinegar and cook for an additional 5 minutes.",
    "Garnish with fresh parsley and serve hot.",
    "Let the casserole rest for 10 minutes before serving.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional parsley if desired."
